{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1759664187\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Child</strong> is a first-person survival horror game set in a dark atmosphere. Find a way out of a deserted apartment complex before the child finds you. You are being hunted, and your life depends on your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a chilling horror experience with realistic graphics, a minimal HUD, and an eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/2bf08f4aa7235d931951f83fd8f0fb15.poster.avif?t=1759664187\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/2bf08f4aa7235d931951f83fd8f0fb15.webm?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/2bf08f4aa7235d931951f83fd8f0fb15.mp4?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the past few weeks, your apartment building has been plagued by unsettling phenomena. Bizarre noises at night, flickering lights, and sudden power outages. As a resident, you\u2019ve pieced together a chilling pattern: the disturbances began when a young couple with a small child moved into an apartment in the building. Since then, strange events have occurred at the exact same time each night. Determined to uncover the truth, you decide to investigate these phenomena.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights fail again, it soon becomes clear that something far worse has happened tonight. It\u2019s dark and quiet. Only one other apartment door stands open... And you\u2019re not alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY ON EDGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dangerous, aggressive entity lurks in the building, playing deadly games, stalking you through the shadows, manipulating your surroundings, and forcing you to confront your deepest fears. Your only chance of survival is to uncover the entity\u2019s true nature and break the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/b357d49e070c2abeb0746a0eecbd6e59.poster.avif?t=1759664187\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/b357d49e070c2abeb0746a0eecbd6e59.webm?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/b357d49e070c2abeb0746a0eecbd6e59.mp4?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your camera and a flashlight, every step draws you closer to the horrifying truth or your own death. Will you escape the hunt, or will you fall victim to <strong>The Child</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.poster.avif?t=1759664187\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.webm?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/c2eb77e3ba2d1ba20296d62d9e31068c.mp4?t=1759664187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare begins when the lights go out. Are you ready?\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357120?t=1759664187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759664187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/38a726cac48443300d1772cdbded5baae1952fd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759664187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/38a726cac48443300d1772cdbded5baae1952fd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759664187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/36895fa93f88824dc68012ca81de9cdb.avif?t=1759664187\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Child</strong> is a first-person survival horror game set in a dark atmosphere. Find a way out of a deserted apartment complex before the child finds you. You are being hunted, and your life depends on your decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a chilling horror experience with realistic graphics, a minimal HUD, and an eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357120/extras/2bf08f4aa7235d931951f83fd8f0fb15.poster.avif?t=1759664187\" width=800 height